{"candidateAnswer":"leashes, treats, sweaters, harnesses","evidence":"[D1:2 | 1:10 pm on 27 March, 2023] Andrew: Hey Audrey! So, I started a new job as a Financial Analyst last week - it's been quite a change from my previous job. How about you? Anything interesting happening?\n[D9:5 | 1:51 pm on 26 June, 2023] Audrey: Yep, I set up a doggy play area in the backyard with agility stuff and toys - they're loving it!\n[D18:10 | 7:49 pm on 6 September, 2023] Audrey: I'm so happy seeing them have a great time. Last week I even got some new beds for them, just to give them some extra comfort now the weather's cooling down and they were happy! It's incredible how such a simple thing can bring them so much happiness.\n[D24:1 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, hope you're doing ok. I recently had a good week - I went to a pet store last Monday to buy toys for my dogs and it was great seeing them so excited when I got them home. It made me realize how much I love them and how much joy they bring me.","itemId":"urn:uuid:0d353e54-62f3-53dc-bcfd-f33a12f69e1d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d7ff8e609c1aa2d6bf9f7d2269dfc6e758fca6d637ccabde8c19a96881393173","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What items has Audrey bought or made for her dogs?","referenceAnswer":"dog tags, toys, dog beds, collars","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d7ff8e609c1aa2d6bf9f7d2269dfc6e758fca6d637ccabde8c19a96881393173"}}]}